  "title": "Fox Corporation Executive Chair and Chief Executive Officer Lachlan Murdoch to Participate in Upcoming Morgan Stanley Technology, Media & Telecom Conference 2026",
  "summary": "New York, NY and Los Angeles, CA – February 23, 2026 – Fox Corporation (Nasdaq: FOXA, FOX) today announced that Executive Chair and Chief Executive Officer Lachlan Murdoch will participate in the Morgan Stanley Technology, Media & Telecom Conference on Monday, March 2, at approximately 9:15am (Pacific), 12:15pm (Eastern). A live and archived webcast of the presentation will […]",
